    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the Arcane Domains!<br><br>This is a short, third person beat-em-up game. Take your mage across the map, rescuing wizards, collecting treasure, and fighting enemies as you work to make the domains safe. Each level takes between 3 - 10 minutes to complete. You have 18 spells available to you at the start of the game, with five additional spells to discover. Summon skeletons, launch fireballs, cast lightning, or whatever else you need in order to save the day.<br><br><u>Cast devastating spells on the lizardmen</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/983790/extras/84dececf18ddcd781c0b48ed5464ea0a.avif?t=1552700862\" /></div><br><br><u>Visit the vast domains</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/983790/extras/98b39d2bb8a4504f8c3ed3ad3fddaf68.avif?t=1552700862\" /></div><br><br><u>Use your spellbook</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/983790/extras/cacd414c8c66bb99875e46028dce50cd.avif?t=1552700862\" /></div><br><br><u>Rescue other wizards to unlock new spells</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/983790/extras/c9dae845a4e90db4da094b37f99ac95e.avif?t=1552700862\" /></div><br><br><u>Find Treasure to help you on your journey</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/983790/extras/41bbb9ef9178bc08f780ff72614d661b.avif?t=1552700862\" /></div><br><br><u>Fight four different bosses</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/983790/extras/ea53ddd0572c6182487651b8dd5968e9.avif?t=1552700862\" /></div><br><br><u>Have a f